  "question": {
    "text": "If the area of the region&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8804;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8805;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the natural number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8804;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8805;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>Now plotting the diagram, we get</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7f7f282d-8627-44b1-bf10-4207f4d53963-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 206px;\" /></p><p>Now from above diagram, given region are,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Now the intersecting point of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, required area will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So, on comparing we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
